# Aetheris Omni-Sphere — Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# SPA Fallback + Security Redirects + Trailing Slash Normalization
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Force HTTPS (Cloudflare handles this, but belt + suspenders) ─────────────
# http://aetheris-omni-sphere.pages.dev/*  https://aetheris-omni-sphere.pages.dev/:splat  301

# ─── Legacy / alternate route aliases ─────────────────────────────────────────
/app   / 301
/home  / 301
/feed  / 301
/pulse / 301

# ─── Do not fallback static assets to index.html ────────────────────────────
/assets/*  /assets/:splat  404

# ─── SPA Fallback: All unmatched routes → index.html (200) ───────────────────
/*  /index.html  200
